001457  3               ;
001457  3               ; CLOSE A FILE
001457  3               ;
001457  3               ; BASIC COMMAND EXPECTS ONE VAR
001457  3               ;
001457  3               ; FILE$
001457  3               ;
001457  3               ; FILE$ = STRING HOLDING 33 BYTE FCB
001457  3               ;__________________________________________________________
001457  3               V_CLOSE:
