003604  1  F0 02                BEQ     LAB_SVTB        ; ok if =
003606  1               
003606  1  B0 20                BCS     TabErr          ; branch if too big
003608  1               
003608  1               LAB_SVTB:
003608  1  86 64                STX     TabSiz          ; save TAB size
00360A  1               
00360A  1               ; calculate tab column limit from TAB size. The Iclim is set to the last tab
00360A  1               ; position on a line that still has at least one whole tab width between it
00360A  1               ; and the end of the line.
00360A  1               
00360A  1               WExit:
