003620  1  A5 0F                LDA     TWidth          ; get width back
003622  1  38                   SEC                     ; set carry for subtract
003623  1  E5 10                SBC     Iclim           ; subtract remainder
003625  1  85 10                STA     Iclim           ; save tab column limit
