003653  1  26 77                ROL     FACt_3          ; .. into remainder
003655  1  26 76                ROL     FACt_2          ; ..
003657  1  26 75                ROL     FACt_1          ; ..
003659  1  26 78                ROL     TempB           ; .. never overflows
00365B  1               LAB_SQE2:
